000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.
000400          SCURCONV.
000500 AUTHOR.
000600     KURT MOVSESIAN.
000800
000900***************************************************************
001000*                                                             *
001100*   S C U R C O N V                                           *
001200*                                                             *
001300*   THIS SUB PROGRAM CONVERTS A PRICE FROM A FOREIGN CURRENCY *
001400*   TO THE HOME CURRENCY VALUES.  YOU MUST PASS THE PRICE     *
001500*   AND CURRENCY CODE.  2 PRICE FIELDS CAN BE USED AND BOTH   *
001600*   ARE CONVERTED THEY ARE IN THE FORMAT OF S9(11)V9(4) AND   *
001700*   S9(11). AN OPTION SWITCH CAN BE PASSED IF YOU DESIRE THE  *
001800*   CONVERSION TO TAKE PLACE EVEN IF THE PLANT IS NOT         *
001900*   CONVERTING PO TCs, MARKET COST, BUDGET AMOUNT.  THIS      *
002000*   SWITCH 'SCURCONV-OVERRIDE-CONV-SW' SHOULD BE SET TO 'Y'   *
002100*   IF THIS IS DESIRED.                                       *
002200***************************************************************
002300
002400
002500 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002600 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002700 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002800 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

002900
003000 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MPLTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS0501.

003100
003200 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".
003300
003400 01  SAVE-AREAS.
003500     05  CC-EXCHANGE-RATE      PIC 9(5)V9(7) VALUE ZEROS COMP-4.
003600     05  HOME-CURRENCY-CALL-SW    PIC X   VALUE SPACES.
003700     05  HOME-CURRENCY-CODE       PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
003800     05  SAVE-CUR-CONV-SW         PIC X    VALUE SPACES.
003900
004000 01  BUILD-CUR-CODE-KEY.
004100     05  FILLER                PIC X(2)  VALUE "CC".
004200     05  BUILD-CUR-CODE        PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
004300
004400
004500**************************************************************
004600**************************************************************
004700**                                                          **
004800**                DATABASE I/O BUFFER AREA                  **
004900**                                                          **
005000**************************************************************
005100**************************************************************
005200
005300 COPY MPLTINFO   IN COPYCSIS.
005400
005500*********************
005600*                   *
005700*   DATA SET NAMES  *
005800*                   *
005900*********************
006000
006100 01  DSET-NAMES.
006200     05  DSET-MPLTINFO          PIC X(16)  VALUE "MPLTINFO;".
006300
006400 01 ITEMS-LISTING.
006500     05  ALL-ITEMS              PIC XX    VALUE "@;".
006600
006700 01  ARG-VALUES.
006800     05  PLT-ARG                PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
006900
007000
007100 COPY DBMODES    IN COPYCSIS.
007200
007300
007400 LINKAGE SECTION.
007500
007600 01  BASE             PIC X(10).
007700
007800 COPY SCURCONV   IN COPYCSIS.
007900
008000 COPY DBSTAT     IN COPYCSIS.
008100
008200 01  BU-DISPLAY-MSG.
008300     05  BU-DISPLAY-MSG-1         PIC X(1).
008400     05  FILLER                   PIC X(59).
008500
008600 01  BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
008700     05  BU-DISPLAY-LINE  OCCURS 5 TIMES.
008800         10  BU-DISPLAY-FLD       PIC X(14).
008900         10  BU-DISPLAY-FLD9      PIC S9(8).
009000
009100
009200
009300 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING  BASE,
009400                           SCURCONV-PARMS,
009500                           STATUS-AREA,
009600                           BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
009700                           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
009800
009900
010000 SCURCONV SECTION 02.
010100
010200 BEGIN-HERE.
           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO-I.

010300     PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-M-X.

           CLOSE MPLTINFO-I.
010400
010500     GOBACK.
010600
010700
010800******************************************************
010900**                                                  **
011000**   BLOWUP ROUTINE                                 **
011100**                                                  **
011200******************************************************
011300
011400 2-BLOWUP.
011500     MOVE "SCURCONV"             TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (5).
011600     GOBACK.
011700
011800
011900 6-MAIN.
012000*************************************
012100**   CONVERT PRICE AND BUDGET AMOUNT
012200**   TO HOME CURRENCY IF THE PLANT
012300**   CHOOSE THE OPTION
012400*************************************
012500     PERFORM 60-CURRENCY-CONVERSION  THRU  60-CC-X.
012600
012700 6-M-X.
012800     EXIT.
012900
013000**************************************************
013100**   THIS PROCEDURE CONVERTS UNIT PRICE AND
013200**   OLD BUDGET AMT TO HOME CURRENCY UNITS IF
013300**   THE PLANT DENOTED THEY DESIRE THIS OPTION
013400**   IN PLANT STARTUP
013500**************************************************
013600
013700 60-CURRENCY-CONVERSION.
013800********************************************
013900**  IF THE CURRENCY CODE IS BLANK AND
014000**  AND PRICE AND OLD BUDGET AMT ARE ZEROS
014100**  THEN THERES NO NEED TO DO THE CONVERSION
014200********************************************
014300     IF SCURCONV-CUR-CODE = SPACES
014400         GO TO 60-CC-X.
014500     IF SCURCONV-PRICE-DEC = ZEROS  AND
014600        SCURCONV-PRICE-WHL = ZEROS
014700         GO TO 60-CC-X.
014800     IF HOME-CURRENCY-CALL-SW = "Y"
014900         GO TO 60-CHECK-CONV-SW.
015000
015100*******************************************
015200**  GET HOME CURRENCY CODE AND CUR-CONV-SW
015300**  FROM MPLTINFO IF THE KEY ISNT FOUND
015400**  EXIT AND DONT DO THE CONVERSION
015500*******************************************
015600
015700     MOVE "Y"                     TO  HOME-CURRENCY-CALL-SW.
015800     MOVE "CCHM"                  TO  PLT-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
015900*    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-MPLTINFO, MODE7,
016000*        STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MPLTINFO, PLT-ARG.
016100     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
016200         IF COND-WORD = 17
016300             MOVE SPACES          TO  HOME-CURRENCY-CODE,
016400                                      SAVE-CUR-CONV-SW
016500             GO TO 60-CC-X
016600         ELSE
016700             MOVE "GET MPLTINFO *60-CC" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
016800             MOVE PLT-ARG         TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
016900             GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
017000     MOVE MPLTINFO-HOME-CUR-CODE  TO  HOME-CURRENCY-CODE,
                                            SCURCONV-HOME-CURRENCY.
017100     MOVE MPLTINFO-CUR-CONV-SW    TO  SAVE-CUR-CONV-SW,
                                            SCURCONV-CUR-CONV-SW.
017200
017300 60-CHECK-CONV-SW.
017400********************************************************************
017500*    IF THE PLANT DOESNT DESIRE THE CURRENCY CONV THEN EXIT
017600*    THIS ROUTINE (SAVE-CUR-CONV-SW NOT = "Y")
017700*    HOWEVER IS THE OVERRIDE SWITCH THAT IS PART OF SCURCONV-PARMS
017800*    IS SET TO 'Y' (SCURCONV-OVERRIDE-CONV-SW ='Y') THEN THE
017900*    CONVERSION IS DONE REGARDLESS OF SAVE-CUR-CONV-SW.
018000********************************************************************
018100
018200     IF SCURCONV-OVERRIDE-CONV-SW = "Y"
018300         NEXT SENTENCE
018400     ELSE
018500         IF SAVE-CUR-CONV-SW NOT = "Y"
018600             GO TO 60-CC-X.
018700     IF HOME-CURRENCY-CODE  =  SPACES OR
018800        HOME-CURRENCY-CODE  =  SCURCONV-CUR-CODE
018900         GO TO 60-CC-X.
019000
019100*******************************************************
019200**  GET FOREIGN CURRENCY CODE FROM MPLTINFO
019300**  IF THE CODE IS NOT FOUND EXIT THE ROUTINE
019400*******************************************************
019500
019600     MOVE SCURCONV-CUR-CODE       TO  BUILD-CUR-CODE.
019700     MOVE BUILD-CUR-CODE-KEY      TO  PLT-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
019800*    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-MPLTINFO, MODE7,
019900*        STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MPLTINFO, PLT-ARG.
020000     IF COND-WORD  NOT = 0
020100         IF COND-WORD = 17
020200             GO TO 60-CC-X
020300         ELSE
020400             MOVE "GET MPLTINFO CCnn*60-CC" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
020500             MOVE PLT-ARG         TO  PLT-ARG
020600             GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
020700     IF MPLTINFO-CC-EXCHANGE-RATE = ZEROS
020800         GO TO 60-CC-X.
020900     DIVIDE 1 BY MPLTINFO-CC-EXCHANGE-RATE
021000         GIVING CC-EXCHANGE-RATE ROUNDED.
021100     MULTIPLY SCURCONV-PRICE-DEC  BY  CC-EXCHANGE-RATE
021200         GIVING SCURCONV-PRICE-DEC  ROUNDED.
021300     MULTIPLY SCURCONV-PRICE-WHL  BY  CC-EXCHANGE-RATE
021400         GIVING SCURCONV-PRICE-WHL  ROUNDED.
021500
021600 60-CC-X.
021700     EXIT.
